*> PLB-K007 commarea-too-short: XCTL or LINK passes less COMMAREA than
*> the DFHCOMMAREA of the program it names.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTMENU.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-KEY              PIC X(11) VALUE SPACES.
01  WS-STATE.
    05  WS-STATE-KEY    PIC X(11).
    05  WS-STATE-PAGE   PIC 9(3).
    05  FILLER          PIC X(186).
01  WS-LEN              PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 200.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: 11 bytes, by the item and by LENGTH.
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('ACCTUPD') COMMAREA(WS-KEY) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('ACCTUPD') COMMAREA(WS-STATE)
        LENGTH(LENGTH OF WS-KEY) END-EXEC
    *> Not reported: the whole state, a LENGTH that is a data item,
    *> and a program that is not in the run.
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('ACCTUPD') COMMAREA(WS-STATE) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('ACCTUPD') COMMAREA(WS-STATE)
        LENGTH(WS-LEN) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('ELSEWHRE') COMMAREA(WS-KEY) END-EXEC
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM ACCTMENU.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTUPD.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  DFHCOMMAREA         PIC X(200).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF EIBCALEN = 0
        EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC
    END-IF
    DISPLAY DFHCOMMAREA(1:11)
    EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
END PROGRAM ACCTUPD.
